## This variant of the variant selection is especially for Ambiendo, or also stores that have products with many variant combinations, for example many color and size options.

| Allow users to select size and color variants display the current size and color variant [as a button on pdp](https://www.figma.com/design/L5EsT6m0VoOXsqqDHXtCe3/laioutr-SHOP?node-id=103-223391&t=wABQtnJ0GubOC0US-4) display number of available  colors and sizes under the [button link ](https://www.figma.com/design/L5EsT6m0VoOXsqqDHXtCe3/laioutr-SHOP?node-id=103-223441&t=wABQtnJ0GubOC0US-4)<custom data-type="emoji" data-id="id-0">:link:</custom>[ ](https://www.figma.com/design/92moLelAY8lh8mI0rhCGzy/laioutr-UI?node-id=17674-464154&t=vDdy4ZSrnFBrmVF4-4) when user clicks on the button, open [off canvas sheet](https://www.figma.com/design/Zle03g3Z7ieN700SDq5j77/Component-Examples?node-id=46-342925&t=PKu1n1KwdC4FDyjD-4) for selection | ![](blob:https://media.staging.atl-paas.net/?type=file&localId=null&id=62df2967-493e-46b6-a2c1-de5b91a651c7&&collection=&height=357&occurrenceKey=null&width=411&__contextId=null&__displayType=null&__external=false&__fileMimeType=null&__fileName=null&__fileSize=null&__mediaTraceId=null&url=null) |
| --- | --- |
| **Off Canvas** Display variants in groups (by color) Group title is the color name optional color swatch in front of the title:  ![](blob:https://media.staging.atl-paas.net/?type=file&localId=null&id=f56b7990-37a2-4eec-a3e5-3d6c09bd9e16&&collection=&height=45&occurrenceKey=null&width=161&__contextId=null&__displayType=null&__external=false&__fileMimeType=null&__fileName=null&__fileSize=null&__mediaTraceId=null&url=null) Each variant is a [button](https://www.figma.com/design/L5EsT6m0VoOXsqqDHXtCe3/laioutr-SHOP?node-id=103-223469&t=wABQtnJ0GubOC0US-4) and can display: thumbnail variant name price infos [delivery and stock information](https://www.figma.com/design/L5EsT6m0VoOXsqqDHXtCe3/laioutr-SHOP?node-id=103-223456&t=wABQtnJ0GubOC0US-4) Selecting a variants loads the correct Product Title, Information, Price and Product images in the background and closes the off canvas | ![](blob:https://media.staging.atl-paas.net/?type=file&localId=null&id=fe7590ec-9cf6-4867-a1a6-21edf9084c68&&collection=&height=790&occurrenceKey=null&width=390&__contextId=null&__displayType=null&__external=false&__fileMimeType=null&__fileName=null&__fileSize=null&__mediaTraceId=null&url=null) ![](blob:https://media.staging.atl-paas.net/?type=file&localId=null&id=826ab666-b3d0-4e19-aa92-3b3a2a2fa1a5&&collection=&height=917&occurrenceKey=null&width=409&__contextId=null&__displayType=null&__external=false&__fileMimeType=null&__fileName=null&__fileSize=null&__mediaTraceId=null&url=null)  |

