_**molecule/MultipleVariantSelection/MultipleVariantSelectionAvailability**_

DIsplays the AmountPills and appropriate texts

```
interface MultipleVariantSelectionAvailabilityProps {
  // @example [{ amount: 4, name: 'Colors', singleName: 'Color' }, { amount: 2, name: 'Sizes', singleName: 'Size' }]  
  options: { amount: number; name: string; singleName?: string; }[]
}
```

If a `singleName` is not given, falls back to `name`. Options are separated by "," Ends with "available". If no options are given, component is not displayed.

![](blob:https://media.staging.atl-paas.net/?type=file&localId=null&id=2da7d554-6bed-4756-b70d-f2a111384f7f&&collection=&height=32&occurrenceKey=null&width=203&__contextId=null&__displayType=null&__external=false&__fileMimeType=null&__fileName=null&__fileSize=null&__mediaTraceId=null&url=null)
_**molecule/MultipleVariantSelection**_/_**MultipleVariantSelectionVariant**_

```
interface VariantSelectionVariant {
  id: string;
  // E.g. [{ wellKnownName: 'color', name: 'Color', value: 'Red' }, { name: 'Size', value: '155x220 + 2x 80x80 cm' }]
  selectedOptions: { name: string; value: string }[]
  image: Media;
  price: Money;
  strikethroughPrice?: Money;
  unitPrice?: UnitPrice; // from @laioutr-core/canonical-types
  stockInfo?: BuyBoxStockInfoProps;
  savingsPercent? : number;
  swatch?: string | string[] | MediaImage // a single color, an array of two colors or a preview-image
}
```

```
interface MultipleVariantSelectionVariantProps {
  variant: VariantSelectionVariant;
}
```

* use reka Ui radio group  `RxRadioGroupItem` , `RxRadioGroupIndicator` <custom data-type="smartlink" data-id="id-2">https://reka-ui.com/docs/components/radio-group</custom>. Each Item is a single RadioGroupItem. The RadioGroup is the Sheet itself.
* emit the variant props to the parent 
* use `LuiIcon` , `LuiText` , `LuiBuyBoxStockInfo` (<custom data-type="smartlink" data-id="id-3">https://laioutr.atlassian.net/browse/LUI-93</custom>) , `LuiMedia` , `LuiProductTileFlag` 

