_**molecule/MultipleVariantSelection/MultipleVariantSelection**_

This is the component that ties all other components together. It renders the _**MultipleVariantSelectionTrigger**_ and the _**MultipleVariantSelectionAvailability**_. When clicking the button it opens the _**MultipleVariantSelectionSheet**_.

```
interface MultipleVariantSelectionProps {
  variants: {
    id: string;
    // E.g. [{ wellKnownName: 'color', name: 'Color', value: 'Red' }, { name: 'Size', value: '155x220 + 2x 80x80 cm' }]
    selectedOptions: { name: string; value: string }[]
    image: Media;
    price: Money;
    strikethroughPrice?: Money;
    unitPrice?: UnitPrice; // from @laioutr-core/canonical-types
    stockInfo?: BuyBoxStockInfoProps;
    savingsPercent? : number;
    swatch?: Swatch // Import from @laioutr-core/canonical-types
  }[];
  groupBy: string; // E.g. 'color' ensures that the variants are grouped by the option with `wellKnownName` 'color'
  selectedVariant: Variant; // (see variants-array before)
```

Add a model using `defineModel` for the selectedVariant. It changes whenever the user selects a different variant in the sheet.

* map the product variants into new array grouped by "groupBy" (default "color") 
* Only group the variants if at least one variant has more than one selectedOption
